      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.57,
      "end_seconds": 20.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "so what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.98,
      "end_seconds": 34.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "uh, it's thoughts of ending my life i thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.36,
      "end_seconds": 39.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.63,
      "end_seconds": 44.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "It's been about a week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.48,
      "end_seconds": 47.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.11,
      "end_seconds": 60.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.57,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get not sleeping for days as well. I'd been feeling hopeless but that that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 61.76,
      "end_seconds": 72.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "doctor, I've got the readings for you saturation 99 percent, temperature is 36.7 degrees, heart rate 71, pressure 110 over 73, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.56,
      "end_seconds": 78.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.01,
      "end_seconds": 83.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "let's move on to the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.81,
      "end_seconds": 87.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "okay, uh, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.17,
      "end_seconds": 90.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 112.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "text": "you are calm but very flat and you have thought through how you would do it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.32,
      "end_seconds": 120.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "you can sit up now have you had any drinking or having taken tablets?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.88,
      "end_seconds": 125.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "so, no, no drinking or having taken tablets"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.27,
      "end_seconds": 132.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any recent loss or hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.28,
      "end_seconds": 136.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Erm, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.39,
      "end_seconds": 140.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.06,
      "end_seconds": 145.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "No, you know, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.56,
      "end_seconds": 150.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.57,
      "end_seconds": 152.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.32,
      "end_seconds": 160.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses? Bear with me I'm just building up the picture"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.8,
      "end_seconds": 180.35,
      "duration_seconds": 18.55,
      "text": "yes, depression it's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it i've got high blood pressure i've had anxiety for about a year now i didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.35,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes. What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.54,
      "end_seconds": 190.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I take mirtazapine, 15 milligrams, at night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.45,
      "end_seconds": 192.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.9,
      "end_seconds": 204.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.26,
      "text": "Lisinopril. I take it 10 milligrams, once a day. Hmm, I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.45,
      "end_seconds": 205.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Okay go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.61,
      "end_seconds": 215.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.34,
      "end_seconds": 220.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.04,
      "end_seconds": 223.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.04,
      "end_seconds": 229.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.94,
      "end_seconds": 232.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.29,
      "end_seconds": 237.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.65,
      "end_seconds": 240.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.37,
      "end_seconds": 244.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.01,
      "end_seconds": 247.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.91,
      "end_seconds": 254.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.03,
      "end_seconds": 267.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Okay, are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.02,
      "end_seconds": 271.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.0,
      "end_seconds": 290.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with a high risk of suicide needing urgent assessment at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.22,
      "end_seconds": 295.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Yeah, is it it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.82,
      "end_seconds": 315.97,
      "duration_seconds": 19.15,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a a high risk of suicide needing urgent assessment, and we'll know more once the an urgent mental health assessment is back i'm gonna order an urgent mental health assessment, for suicidal thoughts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.47,
      "end_seconds": 322.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "that makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.96,
      "end_seconds": 337.44,
      "duration_seconds": 12.48,
      "text": "I want you to stay with me while we arrange help, and your family will be called. Come back straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.29,
      "end_seconds": 342.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Good thanks I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
